  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39619118",
      "title": "GitHub Copilot & Comment-based Prompting",
      "sourceHash": "7bf46b0e8d95db08ba3331cbdc2ad752779abb2aa2608aa0c55c489287582722",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.81,
          "end": 3.93,
          "en": "Now, when working with GitHub Copilot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.93,
          "end": 5.46,
          "en": "in most cases,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.46,
          "end": 9.63,
          "en": "starting a new line or starting to type some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.63,
          "end": 10.77,
          "en": "gets you there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.77,
          "end": 13.86,
          "en": "and gives you a suggestion that makes sense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.86,
          "end": 18.06,
          "en": "but you also sometimes start working on a feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.06,
          "end": 21.48,
          "en": "where there might be so little context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.48,
          "end": 23.46,
          "en": "or that's so specific",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.46,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "that GitHub Copilot just can't give you good suggestions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 33,
          "en": "and good variable or function naming alone isn't enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 37.5,
          "en": "And to show you an example, I'll add a new Footer component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 42.5,
          "en": "a new Footer.jsx file in this components folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.54,
          "end": 46.41,
          "en": "and here, I wanna build a website building block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.41,
          "end": 49.98,
          "en": "that in the end, just chose a copyright and my name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.98,
          "end": 53.19,
          "en": "at the bottom of the page, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.19,
          "end": 56.97,
          "en": "Now for that, I can start typing some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.97,
          "end": 59.85,
          "en": "and export a function named Footer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.85,
          "end": 64.35,
          "en": "and if I do that, I will get some suggestions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.35,
          "end": 67.23,
          "en": "but the suggestions I am getting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.23,
          "end": 69.69,
          "en": "are actually not good enough,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.69,
          "end": 70.74,
          "en": "and here for me,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.74,
          "end": 74.193,
          "en": "it actually even stopped giving me suggestions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.24,
          "end": 79.23,
          "en": "And in such cases, it can be a good strategy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.23,
          "end": 83.13,
          "en": "to write a comment, almost like a prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.13,
          "end": 86.25,
          "en": "where you describe what you wanna achieve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.25,
          "end": 90.87,
          "en": "or which kind of code should come after the comment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.87,
          "end": 92.917,
          "en": "For example, here I could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.917,
          "end": 97.917,
          "en": "\"An exported Footer component that displays my name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 105.09,
          "en": "'Maximilian Schwarzmuller,'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 105.09,
          "end": 107.81700000000001,
          "en": "and the copyright sign.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.22999999999999,
          "end": 111.18,
          "en": "So with that, I'm writing a comment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 111.18,
          "end": 114.15,
          "en": "that describes which kind of thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 114.15,
          "end": 117.423,
          "en": "which kind of code I wanna have after this comment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 119.19,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "Now here, GitHub Copilot then actually starts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 126.6,
          "en": "by suggesting another comment which I can accept,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 126.6,
          "end": 131.49,
          "en": "but then if I start typing \"export default function,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 131.49,
          "end": 136.49,
          "en": "I get a suggestion that indeed gives me the code I wanted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 137.37,
          "end": 139.2,
          "en": "It gives me a Footer component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 139.2,
          "end": 141.45,
          "en": "my name and the copyright sign,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 141.45,
          "end": 144.99,
          "en": "and here I'll just switch the order and update the year,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 144.99,
          "end": 149.99,
          "en": "but with that, I got some code suggested by GitHub Copilot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 150.09,
          "end": 152.823,
          "en": "because I wrote this comment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 153.72,
          "end": 158.25,
          "en": "and that's therefore another very useful trick.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 158.25,
          "end": 161.07,
          "en": "If you can't get GitHub Copilot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 161.07,
          "end": 163.8,
          "en": "to suggest you the code you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 163.8,
          "end": 166.77,
          "en": "you can write a prompt-like comment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 166.77,
          "end": 169.173,
          "en": "and often that will do the trick.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 170.07,
          "end": 174.57,
          "en": "And with that, I could now use this Footer component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 174.57,
          "end": 179.43,
          "en": "at the end of this code in my app component like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 179.43,
          "end": 183,
          "en": "and for this to work, I also need to add this import here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 183,
          "end": 186.27,
          "en": "at the top of the App.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 186.27,
          "end": 188.55,
          "en": "and with all that, if I save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 188.55,
          "end": 190.353,
          "en": "I got this footer here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 192,
          "end": 193.5,
          "en": "But of course now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 193.5,
          "end": 196.71,
          "en": "there still are some styling problems in this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 196.71,
          "end": 198.96,
          "en": "These buttons in the footer for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 198.96,
          "end": 201.03,
          "en": "don't look that great,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 201.03,
          "end": 205.053,
          "en": "and that's another area where GitHub Copilot can help us.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
      "lectureOrder": 308,
      "videoOrder": 308
    }
  ],
